flowchart TD
    DC[External certified DC supply] --> P[Internal power distribution]
    P --> V33[3.3 V logic]
    P --> V5[5 V audio/modules]
    P --> VP[+12 V analog]
    P --> VN[-12 V analog]
    V33 --> ESP[ESP32 / mux / SD]
    V5 --> HP[TDA1308 / compatible modules]
    VP --> AF[Analog filters/op-amps]
    VN --> AF
